    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I *think* this should at very least be doable by specifying everything within the definition of the models<br></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Indeed, you can see how to specify constraints on this page of the tutorial:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/syntax2.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/syntax2.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792425761852000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3UUsgPrbuOWgHTtB98BxFW\">http://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/syntax2.html</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Postdoctoral Researcher, Methods and Statistics</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">UvA web page: <a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792425761852000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0AG93J0f8ix9L7L-omMAI7\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div><div><br></div></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "X_sOrNq-EQAJ",
   "from": "Drew Altschul",
